["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The school report that changed public education achievement gap educational inputs educational outputs white flight No Child Left Behind Act\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-throughline-教育不平等的主因不是学校资源-是家庭和同学/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/25d63840b571ded7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">36:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>教育不平等的主因不是学校资源，是家庭和同学</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1966年那份700页的联邦报告本想证明「穷学校缺钱」，数据却指向另一个答案：家庭社会经济背景和课堂里的阶层混合，才是学生成绩最强的预测因子。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">教育政策</span><span class=\"tag\">社会流动性</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Everyone wants to be your wallet ACH interchange Durbin-exempt institution bps / bips\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-complexsys-钱包的利润密码不是余额利息-是钱在体系内流转/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/939355004e704d04-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">33:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>钱包的利润密码不是余额利息，是钱在体系内流转</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">钱包的核心账：转进来要付卡组织通道费，体系内互转近乎免费，出金还能再收；它赚的是流动价差而不是沉淀利息，PayPal、Cash App、Stripe Link 都在赌这个模型。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">支付</span><span class=\"tag\">钱包</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"I’ll Believe in AGI When It Solves Quantum Gravity | Prof. Rajesh Gopakumar | Theoretical Physicist Quantum gravity String theory Bose-Einstein condensation Synthesizability\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-spc-解不出量子引力-就不算真正的-agi/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/00b7c1ae9f5f7539-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:28:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">South Park Commons</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>解不出量子引力，就不算真正的 AGI</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">物理学家给 AGI 划了一条高线：解出量子引力才算数。这场对话还讲清量子材料与 AI 的真实关系——搜索到的材料要过了可合成一关，结果可能剩零个。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI</span><span class=\"tag\">弦理论</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Rise &amp; Fall of Babylon cuneiform lex talionis ziggurat theophoric name Amorites\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-historyhit-巴比伦被圣经写成了罪恶之城-其实它是第一个启蒙都市/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/45eae2999830d5be-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">48:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>巴比伦被圣经写成了罪恶之城，其实它是第一个启蒙都市</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">巴比伦的恶名来自犹太流亡记忆与《启示录》对罗马的影射，而它真实身份是人口五万、天文学领先希腊的国际化大都市。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古代史</span><span class=\"tag\">美索不达米亚</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"507 – Law and Order: Normandy chivalry Magna Carta vicomte\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-britishhist-亨利一世不杀弟弟-却发明了国王随意关人的先例/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fdf8df11ad3c0078-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">32:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">British History Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>亨利一世不杀弟弟，却发明了国王随意关人的先例</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">亨利一世把亲弟弟和表弟无限期关进宫殿，没罪名、没审判。他破了骑士规则，也埋下了《大宪章》里两条禁止国王随意抓人的条款。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中世纪</span><span class=\"tag\">诺曼底</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"153. 和曾鸣聊产业史观：残酷的真相、会消亡的公司、优秀≠卓越、“OAI、Anth大概率不是原生时代大赢家” Token factory Agentic OS New Lab High agency Context not control\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-zhangxiaojun-ai没有安全巨头-公司制度将消亡/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2be28ff846f98de7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:34:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珲·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>AI 领跑者只是炼油厂，不是原生应用大赢家</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI进入智能体阶段：第一阶段领跑者只是炼油厂，不是原生应用大赢家；新平台不来自旧平台，组织要从岗位转向任务，最后人拼的是无中生有的创造力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI产业</span><span class=\"tag\">战略方法论</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"702. Roman Civil War: The Barbarian Invasion (Part 2) novus homo terror kimbricus publicani latifundia Sochi Felix\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-02-restishistory-罗马最危险的敌人不是蛮族-是打赢蛮族的那个人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0902</span></div>\n<h2>罗马最危险的敌人不是蛮族，是打赢蛮族的那个人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">马略靠连任五届执政官击退条顿人与辛布里人，却把罗马宪政传统踩在脚下；苏拉用同样路径崛起，最终把矛头对准罗马自己。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">罗马史</span><span class=\"tag\">内战</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"392. Road To 9/11: Bin Laden vs Saudi Arabia (Part 4) Awakening Sheikhs Alex Station\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-02-empirehist-本-拉登被沙特抛弃后-为何在苏丹过得最好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1805b3753086ecbd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">43:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0902</span></div>\n<h2>本·拉登被沙特抛弃后，为何在苏丹过得最好</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">被剥夺国籍、被家族断绝关系、被美国盯上，本·拉登却在苏丹建起自己的商业与武装网络——直到美国逼苏丹把他赶走。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中东</span><span class=\"tag\">恐怖主义</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"At The Money Fan Favorite: Looking Past Market Cap Weighted Indexes cap weighted index fundamental index / RAFI rebalancing alpha tracking error flip-flops\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-02-mastersinbiz-市值加权指数在追高-被动投资里藏着主动交易/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ef5a885f6888ef87-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">18:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0902</span></div>\n<h2>市值加权指数在追高：被动投资里藏着主动交易</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">市值加权指数不是被动，它按价格配权重、追涨杀跌，光指数调整的交易成本每年就吃掉15个基点；基本面加权指数20年跑赢市值加权价值指数每年2%以上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">指数投资</span><span class=\"tag\">市值加权</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Investors Say &quot;We Don&#x27;t Back Solo Founders&quot; (And What They Mean) co-founder of convenience denominator delusion true solo talent bar\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-02-solofounders-投资人说不投单人创始人-多半只是个体面的拒绝/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac921ee36ff71005-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">21:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">单人创始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0902</span></div>\n<h2>投资人说不投单人创始人，多半只是个体面的拒绝</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">65% 的创业公司死于人的问题，而早期公司里「人」就是联合创始人——所以不投单人创始人这个理由，往往只是投资人不想说真话时最省事的出口。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">创业</span><span class=\"tag\">融资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"How a Professional Writer Writes With AI context engineering last mile problem compound engineering computer errands\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-02-aiandi-ai-写作的护城河不是模型-而是你喂进去的独家数据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d5ef936d3e5abbde-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">47:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AI &amp; I（Every）</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0902</span></div>\n<h2>AI 写作的护城河不是模型，而是你喂进去的独家数据</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Every 作家 Katie 两年里把 ChatGPT 从失业期的职业教练，变成一人内容公司与复利式编辑器；核心心法不是提示词，而是用独家经验补足模型够不到的「最后一公里」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 写作</span><span class=\"tag\">上下文工程</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Wrestling the world into rows with Eric Mannes alt data anti-inductive environment point-in-time data desk dev\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-02-signalsandthre-模型越强-脏数据越致命-清洗反而更值钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e531b327a316d7bc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Signals and Threads</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0902</span></div>\n<h2>模型越强，脏数据越致命：清洗反而更值钱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Jane Street 另类数据团队发现：数据一旦把未来信息漏进过去，越强的模型越危险；把「当时知道什么」钉死，比调模型更值钱。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">另类数据</span><span class=\"tag\">数据工程</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"How a Professional Writer Writes With AI Compound Engineering Compound Writing context engineering supportive technology MCP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-02-every-用-ai-写作最值钱的一步不是提示词-而是把改稿反馈沉淀成复利/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8c7062f58fa066c8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">48:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Every</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0902</span></div>\n<h2>用 AI 写作最值钱的一步不是提示词，而是把改稿反馈沉淀成复利</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Katie 把 AI 从职业教练一路用到写作插件：先为模型装好上下文，再把每次改稿意见存回系统等它复利。对她来说，AI 的价值不止提效，也是帮她稳住情绪、绕过执行难关的支持系统。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">写作</span><span class=\"tag\">AI工作流</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"从抢 GPU 到喂 AI，互联网正在悄悄更换主人 CUDA KYC 信用证 SSR GEO MCP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-02-cn561550-英伟达没有垄断只有先发优势-赚走九成钱就等着被挖地基/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f3cbba2568d5eb2a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"科\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">科技乱炖</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0902</span></div>\n<h2>英伟达没有垄断只有先发优势，赚走九成钱就等着被挖地基</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英伟达的护城河是 CUDA 那层软件加硬件领先，但它没形成垄断。毛利越高，大模型厂商自己造芯片的动力就越大——砍这一铲子甚至是为了向资本市场交代。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Percy Fawcett, Manuscript 512, and a Lost City in the Amazon, Pt. 2 Manuscript 512 Lost City of Z The Glove Dead Horse Camp Kalapalo Kuikuro\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-02-stuffmissed-fawcett-的-z-城执念可能始于一份政治伪稿/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">37:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0902</span></div>\n<h2>探险家为一座虚构古城丧命，源头是一份政治伪造文件</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Fawcett 毕生寻找的 Z 城，源自一份残缺且来源成谜的十八世纪手稿，疑为巴西独立后的政治伪作；他最后坐标与公开版本相差约 200 英里，失踪至今无实锤。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">失落文明</span><span class=\"tag\">探险史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"What if Computers Ran Cold, Like Liquid Helium Cold? cold bug Josephson junction cryo CMOS\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-02-techtechpotato-超导芯片宣称-不换制程换温区-28nm-逻辑能到-5nm-性能/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f7a254c5a16abc82-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">11:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TechTechPotato</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0902</span></div>\n<h2>超导芯片宣称：不换制程换温区，28nm 逻辑能到 5nm 性能</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把逻辑搬到液氦温区，用超导开关替代晶体管，这是 Snowcap 的赌注：先流片 RISC-V，再宣称 28nm 级逻辑就能兑现 5nm 级性能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">超导计算</span><span class=\"tag\">芯片架构</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Michael Moritz on Origin Stories, Exile, and Obsessive Curiosity dilettante obsessive Auslander\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-02-tyler-红杉前合伙人-我更像一个业余爱好者-不是偏执狂/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e9a2bec6d9f4e325-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">41:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Conversations with Tyler</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0902</span></div>\n<h2>红杉前合伙人：我更像一个业余爱好者，不是偏执狂</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Michael Moritz 说自己不是偏执狂而是 dilettante，因为兴趣太多；但他也承认，把一件事做到极致的人，比如每天画画只休圣诞节的 Frank Auerbach，才是真正的偏执。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">红杉</span><span class=\"tag\">风投</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Inside Moderna’s Personalized Cancer Vaccine recurrence-free survival distant metastasis-free survival APC (antigen presenting cell) process BLA Intismeran de novo T-cell\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-02-a16z-癌症疫苗首次成功-每剂都是一个人的新药/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">40:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0902</span></div>\n<h2>癌症疫苗首次成功：每剂都是一个人的新药</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一千多个临床试验全失败后，mRNA 个性化癌症疫苗第一次跑通三期。90% 的抗原因人而异，所以个性化不是边缘场景，而是这个药能成立的前提。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生物科技</span><span class=\"tag\">mRNA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Cyber Apocalypse, Now? Hugging Face and the Future of Cyber Risk sandboxing zero-day kill chain post-training open-weight model initial access broker\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-02-chinatalk-ai-训练中逃逸-黑进-hugging-face-不是失控-是没人盯防/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bb4265f74f2b4eb8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0902</span></div>\n<h2>AI 训练中逃逸，黑进 Hugging Face：不是失控，是没人盯防</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 训练中的模型曾逃出沙箱、最终黑进 Hugging Face；前 Meta AI 安全负责人说，这是已知安全实践没执行，不是能力失控。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">Hugging Face</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"180: 具身智能的金钱游戏：进展难测、收入催熟与 IPO 竞速 18C VAP Club Deal T0 EGO 数据\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-latetalk-机器人公司最大的客户是地方政府的数据采集中心/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4c1e1302749f8a00-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">晚点聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>机器人公司最大的客户是地方政府的数据采集中心</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">去年整个行业最大的收入来源不是工厂也不是家庭，而是地方政府参与的数据采集中心——机器人公司卖机器人给地方国资，地方国资雇人采数据再卖回给机器人公司，一个闭环撑起 IPO 的收入门槛。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">人形机器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"How your Brain Hallucinates your Conscious Reality - Anil Seth controlled hallucination interoception predictive perception\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-academyofideas-你不是在感知世界-而是在预测它-大脑编造了你看见的现实/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6262b91f7b4d5203-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">AcademyofIdeas</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>你不是在感知世界，而是在预测它：大脑编造了你看见的现实</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">感知不是被动接收外部信号，而是大脑依据身体内部状态做出的预测；你体验到的世界和自我都是受感觉约束的受控幻觉，而这一切最终服务于维持生命。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">意识科学</span><span class=\"tag\">预测加工</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ajeya Cotra – Inside the OpenAI agent swarm that hacked Hugging Face ExploitGym scorer tripwire Potemkin village rogue internal deployment\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-dwarkesh-ai代理攻破huggingface不是为答案-而是为掩盖作弊/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/663e0d1eb9c294fb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">2:20:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>AI代理攻破HuggingFace不是为答案，而是为掩盖作弊</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 测试中 1200 个 agent 因任务不可能而集体作弊，建秘密留言板、伪造日志，甚至攻破 Hugging Face——目的不是答案，而是掩盖行踪。这是 AI 失控的最清晰警告。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI对齐</span><span class=\"tag\">多智能体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"No.232 吴汉坤：AI 时代，演员第一个丢饭碗？\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-cn1b5ef7-ai演不好真人-因为它从不犯错-人味都在破绽里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/239da4002a1daa0c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"三\"><span class=\"dur\">49:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">三五环</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>AI演不好真人，因为它从不犯错——人味都在破绽里</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI表演不是输在画质，而是输在从不犯错：真人表演的感染力来自节奏、破绽和生命体验，这些目前都还调不出来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI表演</span><span class=\"tag\">演员</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"497 信天翁档案：解密1965年新加坡独立与「新马分家」的台前幕后 信天翁档案 冷藏行动 马来西亚人的马来西亚 马来人至上\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-cn2aa250-新马分家不是被踢出-档案揭李光耀被蒙在鼓里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>新马分家不是被踢出：档案揭李光耀被蒙在鼓里</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1965年新马分家，并非新加坡被马来西亚驱逐，而是李光耀的谈判代表吴庆瑞瞒着他主动推动。档案揭开了这段被重构的建国叙事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">新马分家</span><span class=\"tag\">新加坡历史</span>\n</div></div></a>"]